Controls attached devices, apps, and websites: list, boot, drive, and inspect them, one command or one JSON document at a time

Usage: leptoskit device <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list            Lists everything attached right now: simulators, phones, emulators, AVDs, the desktop, and browsers with installed drivers
  boot            Boots a simulator or AVD and waits for it to finish
  shutdown        Shuts a simulator down, or stops the emulator behind a serial
  run             Runs one control document from a file or standard input
  screenshot      Saves a screenshot: the device's whole screen, or the app's window when `--app` or `--url` names a session
  tap             Clicks a visible control
  enter-text      Replaces the text of a visible input
  type-text       Types into whatever has focus
  expect-visible  Waits for exactly one visible control
  expect-text     Waits for a control's exact visible text
  source          Reads the accessibility tree or page source
  start-app       Launches an installed app by bundle id or package
  stop-app        Terminates an installed app
  logs            Reads recent system logs
  help            Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
